combine found and made marks meaningfully."}, {"id": "2504e093-4b9d-4265-9f7b-9465dc78602d", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Digital extension", "children": [{"id": "4c5de606-c320-4016-b009-88986de2427a", "type": "concept", "title": "Scanning, cleanup, layering, tablet drawing, projection, and print output"}, {"id": "e47238f7-8238-4b40-8f6e-08ba6bd195b8", "type": "concept", "title": "Analog-digital loops"}, {"id": "2ea3f4a0-8b76-4c4c-a0df-ff7d7acaff18", "type": "concept", "title": "File quality and documentation"}], "description": "Students use digital tools as part of drawing rather than a replacement for it."}]}, {"id": "3e6a2927-46e8-498a-87b1-bf18f7f77706", "type": "topic", "title": "Large-Scale Drawing: Body, Duration, Repetition, Installation, and Physical Process", "description": "Students learn how scale changes gesture, time, composition, surface, and viewer experience.", "children": [{"id": "9c4f1747-efb9-4240-b051-79c2d176b617", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Scale and body", "children": [{"id": "832db36e-9fb6-4cd3-82b0-5b71970d2b70", "type": "concept", "title": "Arm movement, full-body gesture, reach, stamina, and physical rhythm"}, {"id": "0693e1bf-a949-4871-bc65-355991a75501", "type": "concept", "title": "Viewing distance and immersive presence"}, {"id": "ebeeefec-5297-4ead-882e-baa8465e23f7", "type": "concept", "title": "Paper rolls, wall drawing, floor drawing, and installation supports"}], "description": "Students learn how large formats change movement and decision-making."}, {"id": "94c4a0a7-0be7-472e-920f-1da02c8381d4", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Duration and repetition", "children": [{"id": "c10614ea-8821-4495-ad60-95ccbe8bda2e", "type": "concept", "title": "Accumulation, serial marks, grids, endurance, daily practice, and process rules"}, {"id": "1b35a097-aa68-4803-b5d4-aeb8d16c5d67", "type": "concept", "title": "Repetition as variation"}, {"id": "131dd17a-01db-4b46-bba1-33eea7c5c507", "type": "concept", "title": "Time-based documentation"}], "