ement structure"}, {"id": "ed8e3657-b82c-472b-984e-de737f969fee", "type": "concept", "title": "Writing without overexplaining"}], "description": "The point is to communicate process and intent clearly."}, {"id": "2c6d52e7-03dc-4fc4-9bd6-27c33b28643b", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Studio habits", "children": [{"id": "ef6d4a78-6b83-4aac-85d9-b1d667c565be", "type": "concept", "title": "Daily drawing, material tests, sketchbook practice, cleanup, storage, and reflective logs"}, {"id": "e6a4e6e4-f000-4369-a280-1022c76d04af", "type": "concept", "title": "Studio safety and care for tools"}, {"id": "557a4d8e-acd3-4ac9-932b-a53508f6f406", "type": "concept", "title": "Persistence through uncertainty"}], "description": "Students build sustainable creative routines."}]}, {"id": "696879a8-a931-4343-ad26-d83086768654", "type": "topic", "title": "Series and Projects: Proposal, Iteration, Research, Peer Review, and Revision", "description": "This module guides students from individual exercises into coherent projects that develop over time.", "children": [{"id": "77807b52-93ac-4290-9743-4c8cc4d78a25", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Project proposal", "children": [{"id": "3e985fc1-da5a-4eac-a8bf-489fd17707b8", "type": "concept", "title": "Concept, question, materials, scale, timeline, references, and criteria"}, {"id": "ffb08e10-5cc0-447a-869f-a5452f23b236", "type": "concept", "title": "Feasibility and ambition"}, {"id": "9b3c2f52-36fc-4095-b9cf-49026c4c3d8e", "type": "concept", "title": "Proposal sketches and test pieces"}], "description": "Students define a coherent drawing project."}, {"id": "5801e4be-9d44-4032-a538-f475dca99a0e", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Iteration and revision", "children": [{"id": "eea0e37a-a60a-4d65-8521-e912ca7598c9", "type": "concept", "title": "Studies, variations, critique response, reworking, and sequencing"}, {"id": "16d8ac3f-f8a4-43f8-8442-69a594595273", "type": "concept", "title": "Risk-taking and editing"}, {"id": "0bbdc5b4-5e60-4d8d-927c-4a9313674710", "type": "concept", "title": "Failure as information"}], "description": "The gist is to develop work through cycles."}, {"id": "00aa9674-a4a7-4921-9e27-56f6324f856d", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Research and references", "children": [{"id": "16740bf0-f2b6-49d6-8a82-c8b2d7a6291a", "type": "concept", "title": "Artist models, exhibitions, readings, archives, and visual precedents"}, {"id": "3006c8ad-45d6-4243-9f15-705ffee7bff5", "type": "concept", "title": "Annotated references"}, {"id": "189baf89-bca6-4e0d-a093-72095ad2f0f7", "type": "concept", "title": "Influence versus imitation"}], "description": "Students connect studio work to artists and ideas."}]}, {"id": "4ce80489-8e9d-4b6e-8cea-ce449f6f837a", "type": "topic", "title": "Portfolio-Ready Drawing Capstone: Cohesive Series, Public Presentation, and Next-Step Plan", "description": "Students synthesize the course by producing a finished drawing series, portfolio documentation, statement, and plan for future development.", "children": [{"id": "7e2d0664-c953-4c15-9e50-d9aef2ae7b4f", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Cohesive series", "children": [{"id": "677dc243-4aaf-467c-9c0f-b548f4ef303a", "type": "concept", "title": "Three to six resolved drawings or an equivalent expanded project"}, {"id": "2478163e-521e-42a3-90d8-01b655f0d0da", "type": "concept", "title": "Material consistency or purposeful variation"}, {"id": "f2c2345e-3cb4-4ab9-a366-21b81b5fb048", "type": "concept", "title": "Series title and conceptual through-line"}], "description": "Students synthesize skills into a focused body of work."}, {"id": "7a90801e-5d86-4336-a183-d180a8d28019", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Public presentation", "children": [{"id": "3578f04c-12bd-4884-b7e1-6178f2293ce7", "type": "concept", "title": "Installation plan, documentation images, artist statement, labels, and oral presentation"}, {"id": "335d4b57-534f-48a2-b6a6-5a3afea9ecce", "type": "concept", "title": "Audience experience and sequencing"}, {"id": "055e3f8d-329e-4cd